    "endFrameDescription": "Dokładny powrót do profilowej kotwicy drugiej salwy z final-08b-1 revision 2: Czesław nadal zmęczony i spięty, ale bez odrzutu i niebieskiego poblasku.",
    "animation": "One continuous two-second auspex-side reaction with no cut. Start at peak recoil: Czeslaw's harness is taut, glasses displaced, jaw open and blue residual light burns across his profile and reflection. His involuntary breath ends, shoulders settle only partly, glasses remain wet, grip never leaves the control, and his eyes reopen toward the auspex with heavier fear than before. Blue light, dust and sparks fade while rain continues. Finish exactly on the supplied final-08b-1 revision 2 profile anchor for a salwa-B-only loop. Preserve identity, helmet, auspex geometry, single hand and camera. No calm reset, new trigger pull, color change, morphing, text or watermark."
